<</Type/Annot/Rect[64.7500 404.5000 547.2500 704.5000]/Border[0 0 0]/Subtype/Link/A<</Type/Action/S/URI/URI(spisticky: StickyComments: The quality of the figures is appalling. I have provided original vector graphics \(PDF\), yet only the axes and text are vectorised and the rest is rasterised \(pixellated\). You must vectorise everything! If you are not capable of doing so, I will provide high quality raster files such as PNG or TIFF. Also, I expect all figures to have the same full width, spanning from the left text margin to the right text margin. This figure especially is much narrower than the first two. They all were designed with identical width!!@#Role: Author!@#Action: Image Comment!@#User: luka.wright@research.uwa.edu.au!@#!@#DataDate: 30/10/2026_01:20:31!@#~SPIDELIMITER~143~SPIDELIMITER~20~SPIDELIMITER~366.666676839193~SPIDELIMITER~399.21875~SPIDELIMITER~400)>>>>
endobj
